&lt;h4 class=&quot;heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-LcTydzNNpoS3O6xVEQCl58opgZg&quot;&gt;About the Team&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZ6cdcSRDoOpFgxyjYUl5Y88g7h&quot;&gt;You will join our global Web3 Growth Team and support the &lt;strong&gt;global growth and ecosystem development of DeFi-related and broader on-chain initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CcQdd2ThPofz3Nxk1YGljH9lgHh&quot;&gt;This is a global role working with Product, Business Development, Marketing, Engineering, and other teams across multiple countries and regions to develop product, user, and ecosystem opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OD5cdIn5toIxQMxJPRHlJ9s3ghR&quot;&gt;Responsibilities will be carried out in accordance with applicable laws, regulations, and company policies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OD5cdIn5toIxQMxJPRHlJ9s3ghR&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OD5cdIn5toIxQMxJPRHlJ9s3ghR&quot;&gt;
