&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;ICg8dcrqNohbEMxVh0Tusc7hsZz&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-SOJTdq885oxPNjxXfuquxFfSsLW&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;UdzSdrVlAoctZ7xkfZfl7kzSguc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AElmd7ROGoLWzpxHjonlx1svgMb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;DVjId5NPOownzcxbm4TlBLXXgod&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;NvfDdC00wom47dx8o4AlrRFLgtc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 data-page-id=&quot;NvfDdC00wom47dx8o4AlrRFLgtc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;About the Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;NvfDdC00wom47dx8o4AlrRFLgtc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the team that builds and operates our core data platform—the backbone for public market data and proprietary trading data across the business. The platform captures high-throughput data from global crypto exchanges, ingests trading events from internal desks and systems, and provides reliable real-time and historical data products to trading, quantitative research, risk, and analytics teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accuracy, reliability, and timeliness are critical because the platform supports live trading, risk management, research, and reporting. We are looking for a hands-on Senior Market &amp;amp; Trading Data Engineer (Java) to build and operate the platform end to end, from ingestion and normalization to streaming, storage, access services, and production infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build and operate high-throughput Java pipelines for public market data, including trades, best bid and offer (BBO), tickers, funding rates, and L2/full order-book data from exchange REST and WebSocket APIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build and operate pipelines for proprietary trading data, including orders, fills, positions, balances, risk, and other events delivered through Kafka and internal integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Own ingestion, parsing, normalization, sequencing, validation, recovery, storage, and data access, with a strong focus on correctness, reliability, and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Onboard new exchanges and internal data sources, handling authentication, rate limits, disconnects, resubscription, snapshots and deltas, protocol changes, schema evolution, reconciliation, and access control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build real-time and historical data paths using technologies such as Chronicle Queue, Kafka, relational and time-series databases, Apache Iceberg, Parquet, and ClickHouse. Own schema design, partitioning, retention, and query performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Develop and operate data-access services and APIs, including routing, service discovery, high availability, failover, authorization for proprietary data, and backward compatibility for downstream clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Maintain platform stability through monitoring, alerting, capacity management, data-quality checks, reconciliation, incident response, post-incident follow-through, and reproducible runbooks. Participate in the on-call rotation and respond to PagerDuty incidents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Support trading desks, quantitative researchers, and analytics users with data access, source onboarding, query support, and Java/Python client libraries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Maintain and improve the existing production platform while delivering safe, incremental migrations toward Kafka, ClickHouse, Iceberg, and Kubernetes through parallel runs, reconciliation, and controlled cutovers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Use AI coding assistants and LLM tooling responsibly to accelerate development, debugging, and data operations, and help the team adopt effective AI-native workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Bachelor’s degree or above in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related quantitative field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• 5+ years of hands-on experience in software engineering, market-data engineering, trading systems, or data-platform engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong production Java performance-tuning skills, including JVM and concurrency fundamentals, profiling, garbage collection and allocation behavior, and diagnosing thread and I/O bottlenecks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Hands-on experience building and operating real-time pipelines or data-serving systems for exchange market data, tick/order-book data, or proprietary trading data such as orders, fills, positions, balances, and risk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience building and operating production streaming pipelines, ideally with Kafka.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong command of real-time event correctness, including ordering and sequencing, duplicate and gap detection, offsets and checkpoints, restart recovery, replay and backfill, idempotency, backpressure, reconciliation, and data validation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong SQL skills and production experience with a time-series or analytical database such as ClickHouse, QuestDB, or InfluxDB, including data modeling, partitioning, retention design, and query-performance tuning at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong distributed-systems fundamentals, with depth in one or more of the following: data APIs, routing and service discovery, high availability and failover, failure recovery, authorization, or backward-compatible data and client contracts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• An ownership and operational mindset, with a strong focus on correctness, monitoring, reconciliation, data quality, backfills, incident response, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Comfortable participating in an on-call rotation and owning the investigation, mitigation, and prevention of production incidents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience maintaining or safely migrating a legacy production data system while keeping critical services available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Proactive use of AI tools in day-to-day engineering, with sound judgment around verification, security, and safety.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong communication skills and fluency in English and Chinese.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience building exchange REST/WebSocket connectors or feed handlers, particularly for order-book snapshot/delta streams, sequence and gap recovery, or exchange protocol changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Knowledge of market microstructure, electronic trading, tick-data platforms, or market-by-order/market-by-price data models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Hands-on experience with ClickHouse or a comparable analytical database; Iceberg/Parquet or a comparable lakehouse; gRPC/Protobuf; Kubernetes; or service-discovery tools such as etcd. Expertise across every component is not expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience developing data-access APIs or client libraries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Python experience for supporting tooling, analytics, and data operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience with batch processing for historical data, reconciliation, backfills, or analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Exposure to AI/ML tooling or data products for model training and research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Interest in learning Rust for performance-critical components.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Competitive total compensation package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Learning and development programs and education subsidy for employees’ growth and development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Various team-building programs and company events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Wellness and meal allowances.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Comprehensive healthcare schemes for employees and dependents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• More that we would love to tell you about during the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-font-italic&quot; data-eleid=&quot;32&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Please note that Hong Kong is a group-level service hub, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;OKX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; does not carry on a business of operating a virtual asset trading platform in Hong Kong.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
